---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<Layout title="Pandora-Inspired Unreal Environment" description="A Pandora-inspired real-time environment built in Unreal Engine 5.4.">
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
    <p class="tag mb-3">CGI/VFX · Real-Time · Kumaraguru College of Technology</p>
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-hi)]">Pandora-Inspired Environment</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-[var(--text-mid)]">Personal project · December 2025 · built in roughly one week</p>

    <div class="rule my-10"></div>

    <section class="space-y-3 mb-10">
      <h2 class="text-lg text-[var(--amber)]">Concept</h2>
      <p class="text-[var(--text-mid)] leading-relaxed">
        A Pandora-inspired real-time environment built in Unreal Engine 5.4 — not an official or licensed asset,
        but an original scene built in that visual spirit: dense bioluminescent-feeling terrain, layered foliage,
        and atmospheric lighting.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3 mb-10">
      <h2 class="text-lg text-[var(--amber)]">Process</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-[var(--text-mid)] space-y-1.5">
        <li>Terrain sculpting and world building in Unreal Engine 5.4</li>
        <li>Foliage systems and layered vegetation</li>
        <li>Lighting and particle effects for atmosphere</li>
        <li>Supporting 3D modeling in Blender</li>
        <li>Cinematic camera work and rendering for the final sequences</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-lg text-[var(--amber)]">Video showcase</h2>
      <p class="text-[var(--text-mid)] text-sm">Three finished cinematic passes from the project.</p>
      <div class="mt-5 space-y-6">
        <video controls preload="metadata" class="w-full border border-[var(--line)]" aria-label="The Horizon cinematic pass"><source src={`${base}media/projects/pandora/the-horizon.mp4`} type="video/mp4" /></video>
        <video controls preload="metadata" class="w-full border border-[var(--line)]" aria-label="Ancient Stillness cinematic pass"><source src={`${base}media/projects/pandora/ancient-stillness.mp4`} type="video/mp4" /></video>
        <video controls preload="metadata" class="w-full border border-[var(--line)]" aria-label="Environment art reel"><source src={`${base}media/projects/pandora/environment-art.mp4`} type="video/mp4" /></video>
      </div>
    </section>

    <a href={`${base}#projects`} class="tag inline-block mt-10">&larr; Back to projects</a>
  </article>
</Layout>
